  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "不好意思，\n请问这家咖啡店已经停业了吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D597D610F601DFF0C000A8BF795EE8FD95BB6549655615E975DF27ECF505C4E1A4E865417FF1F00100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来是的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B6765662F76840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "听说发生了很多事",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "542C8BF453D1751F4E865F88591A4E8B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是这样啊……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我时隔10年再到这座城市来，\n本想喝一杯这里的咖啡的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F8FD96837554A2026202600100001BE01000A621165F69694003100305E74518D52308FD95EA757CE5E026765FF0C000A672C60F3559D4E00676F8FD991CC7684549655617684300200100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请问……您是否认识\n这家店的相关人员呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF795EE2026202660A8662F54268BA48BC6000A8FD95BB65E97768476F851734EBA54585462FF1F00100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我认识",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118BA48BC60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要我问一下吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981621195EE4E004E0B5417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就拜托您了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C3162DC625860A84E86FF0100100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要问谁呢？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "898195EE8C015462FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "古历",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53E453860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "古丽兹",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53E44E3D51790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有什么事吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094EC04E484E8B5417FF1F00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "原来是这样啊。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n那请你去问问新咖啡\n3号店的店长吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "539F6765662F8FD96837554A300200100001BE01000A90A38BF74F6053BB95EE95EE65B054965561000A003353F75E9776845E97957F5427300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因为她以前\n是在老板手下工作的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E04E3A59794EE5524D000A662F57288001677F624B4E0B5DE54F5C7684300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "叫外卖吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EB591653565417FF1F00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什么嘛。\n原来是找人啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC04E48561B3002000A539F6765662F627E4EBA554A300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "弗拉达利咖啡店的老板？\n那你得问3号店的店长了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F1762C98FBE5229549655615E9776848001677FFF1F000A90A34F605F9795EE003353F75E9776845E97957F4E86300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因为她以前应该是\n在老板手下工作的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E04E3A59794EE5524D5E948BE5662F000A57288001677F624B4E0B5DE54F5C7684300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来只要去新咖啡3号店，\n就能知道老板的情况了啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B676553EA898153BB65B054965561003353F75E97FF0C000A5C3180FD77E590538001677F768460C551B54E86554AFF0100100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我记得3号店是在……\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>蓉粉区<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118BB05F97003353F75E97662F572820262026000A00100002FF00000684C97C89533A00100002FF000000FF1F00100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那我们就在\n新咖啡3号店会合吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A362114EEC5C315728000A65B054965561003353F75E974F1A54085427FF0100100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n恭候多时了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A606D5019591A65F64E86FF0100100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那我们去打听一下\n弗拉达利咖啡店老板的事吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A362114EEC53BB6253542C4E004E0B000A5F1762C98FBE5229549655615E978001677F76844E8B5427300200100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要点些……看来你们不是来点单的。\n有什么需要帮忙的吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "898170B94E9B20262026770B67654F604EEC4E0D662F676570B9535576843002000A67094EC04E48970089815E2E5FD976845417FF1F00100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "原来如此，\n情况我已经了解了。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n弗拉达利咖啡店的老板\n是教我做咖啡的师父。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "539F676559826B64FF0C000A60C551B562115DF27ECF4E8689E34E86300200100001BE01000A5F1762C98FBE5229549655615E9776848001677F000A662F65596211505A5496556176845E087236300200100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果把客人的事告诉老板，\n我想老板也会很高兴的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C628A5BA24EBA76844E8B544A8BC98001677FFF0C000A621160F38001677F4E5F4F1A5F889AD851747684300200100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会联系老板的，\n请在弗拉达利咖啡店的前面稍等一下。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F1A80547CFB8001677F7684FF0C000A8BF757285F1762C98FBE5229549655615E977684524D97627A0D7B494E004E0B300200100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那我就去弗拉达利咖啡店的前面\n等待各位了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A362115C3153BB5F1762C98FBE5229549655615E977684524D9762000A7B495F8554044F4D4E86FF0100100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会联系老板的，\n请在弗拉达利咖啡店稍等一下。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F1A80547CFB8001677F7684FF0C000A8BF757285F1762C98FBE5229549655615E977A0D7B494E004E0B300200100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没想到能见到老板……\n我感觉开始心跳加速了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA160F3523080FD89C152308001677F20262026000A6211611F89C95F0059CB5FC38DF352A0901F4E86300200100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "久等了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E457B494E86300200100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这位就是老板，\n梅导尔师父。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94F4D5C31662F8001677FFF0C000A68855BFC5C145E087236300200100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是前任老板啦。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n过了10年还有人想喝我的咖啡，\n真是太荣幸了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F524D4EFB8001677F5566300200100001BE01000A8FC74E86003100305E748FD867094EBA60F3559D6211768454965561FF0C000A771F662F592A83635E784E86300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是有一个问题……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我以前会用宝可梦的招式\n来烘焙咖啡，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但毕竟有一大段空白期。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F67094E004E2A95EE98982026202600100001BE01000A62114EE5524D4F1A75285B9D53EF68A6768462DB5F0F000A676570D8711954965561FF0C00100001BE00000A4F466BD57ADF67094E0059276BB57A7A767D671F300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我有个请求。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n请和我来一场宝可梦对战吧。\n这样我能找回一些感觉。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5621167094E2A8BF76C42300200100001BE01000A8BF7548C621167654E00573A5B9D53EF68A65BF9621854273002000A8FD96837621180FD627E56DE4E004E9B611F89C9300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "老板，我也要一起战斗！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8001677FFF0C62114E5F89814E008D7762186597FF0100100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿&",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没想到能和拯救了城市的英雄对战……\n我的感觉也找回来了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA160F3523080FD548C62EF65514E8657CE5E02768482F196C45BF9621820262026000A62117684611F89C94E5F627E56DE67654E86300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么，请来咖啡店吧。\n我这就来准备咖啡。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E48FF0C8BF76765549655615E9754273002000A62118FD95C31676551C6590754965561300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿)",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然有点脏，但状态还不错。\n只要洗干净就没问题了吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D7136670970B9810FFF0C4F4672B660018FD84E0D95193002000A53EA89816D175E7251C05C316CA195EE98984E865427FF1F00100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是的……\n我会端出那时的咖啡。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F768420262026000A62114F1A7AEF51FA90A365F6768454965561300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要准备一下，\n请先落座，稍作等待吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211898151C659074E004E0BFF0C000A8BF75148843D5EA7FF0C7A0D4F5C7B495F855427300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊……\n是那时的咖啡。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554A20262026000A662F90A365F6768454965561300200100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这股扑鼻而来的强烈香气……\n就让我用全身好好品味吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD980A162519F3B800C676576845F3A70C899996C1420262026000A5C318BA96211752851688EAB597D597D54C154735427300200100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "老板！这咖啡和10年前一样……\n不，比10年前还要好。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8001677FFF018FD954965561548C003100305E74524D4E00683720262026000A4E0DFF0C6BD4003100305E74524D8FD88981597D300200100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "您给了我最棒的评价啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A87ED94E866211670068D276848BC44EF7554A300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是，我必须要向客人您道歉。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662FFF0C62115FC5987B898154115BA24EBA60A890536B49300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这是说到哪里去了？\n您做出这么美味的咖啡，却要道歉？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9662F8BF4523054EA91CC53BB4E86FF1F000A60A8505A51FA8FD94E487F8E5473768454965561FF0C5374898190536B49FF1F00100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这杯咖啡是我泡的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9676F54965561662F62116CE17684300200100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什么！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 2780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC04E48FF01FF1F00100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我本来是个聘来的老板，\n因为闪焰队的事件隐退了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 2800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211672C6765662F4E2A8058676576848001677FFF0C000A56E04E3A95EA7130961F76844E8B4EF6969090004E86300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过店长说无论如何都想留住那份味道。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 2860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC75E97957F8BF465E08BBA59824F5590FD60F375594F4F90A34EFD54739053300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然城市会不断变化，\n但也有一些东西不能变。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n老板的咖啡就是其中之一。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 2908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713657CE5E024F1A4E0D65AD53D85316FF0C000A4F464E5F67094E004E9B4E1C897F4E0D80FD53D8300200100001BE00000A8001677F7684549655615C31662F51764E2D4E4B4E00300200100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "即使曾住在密阿雷的人和宝可梦不在了，\n我还是想把他们各自的生活方式<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n以某种形式保存下来。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 2996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53734F7F66FE4F4F57285BC6963F96F776844EBA548C5B9D53EF68A64E0D57284E86FF0C000A62118FD8662F60F3628A4ED64EEC540481EA7684751F6D3B65B95F0F00100001BE00000A4EE567D079CD5F625F0F4FDD5B584E0B6765300200100002011401B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是啊……今后还能喝到我最喜欢的咖啡，\n对此我要表示感谢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F554A202620264ECA540E8FD880FD559D523062116700559C6B22768454965561FF0C000A5BF96B64621189818868793A611F8C22300200100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然不知道会是哪天，\n但再来密阿雷的时候，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我会来喝店长做的咖啡。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D71364E0D77E590534F1A662F54EA5929FF0C000A4F46518D67655BC6963F96F7768465F65019FF0C00100001BE00000A62114F1A6765559D5E97957F505A768454965561300200100002011401B70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "随时恭候您的到来。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "968F65F6606D501960A8768452306765300200100002011401B90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    }
